    <string name="about_problem_title">The problem it solves</string>
    <string name="about_problem_body">Good words get saved in notes and screenshots, then never read again. Smrti brings them back to you, gently, at the times you choose and with a picture you love, so a good thought finds you instead of you having to look for it.</string>
    <string name="about_how_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="about_how_1">Add quotes in the Quotes tab: type your own, or import a whole list.</string>
    <string name="about_how_2">Add pictures in the Images tab (optional).</string>
    <string name="about_how_3">On Home, choose how often you want a reminder. Set quiet hours in Settings.</string>
    <string name="about_how_4">Allow notifications when asked. Tap a reminder to read it here, and star the ones you love.</string>
    <string name="about_how_5">Add the widget from Settings to see your latest quote on the home screen.</string>
